{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Slash to the beat</strong> in this <strong>stylish, pixelated rhythm game</strong> as you ascend the neon-lit tower of a corrupt corporation. Armed with your trusty sword, battle through waves of enemies in <strong>six high-energy songs</strong>, each pushing your reflexes and rhythm to the limit.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Face off against <strong>three distinct types of robotic enemies</strong>, each with their own unique properties. Between battles, unravel the story through quirky and chaotic <strong>cutscenes</strong> featuring your deranged scientific rival.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Will you reclaim your volcano and stop the madness, or will the rhythm get the better of you?</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Game Features</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Rhythm-based Action!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Six unique soundtracks!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Three types of Enemies!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Chaotic Storyline!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Pixel-Perfect Style!</p></li></ul>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3060110?t=1746550569","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3060110/c001d177aa37107e36c42dbb9055238e08bc7dc9/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1746550569","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3060110/9a086219066b65cc1a1e79984c8d8230ab6f5aee/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1746550569","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3060110/9a086219066b65cc1a1e79984c8d8230ab6f5aee/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1746550569","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Full controller support","id":28}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"controller_support":"full","detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Slash to the beat</strong> in this <strong>st